<div class="aq-page">
<section class="aq-section aq-limit-drawer-sec"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">Who writes your limit, and what to send</h2><p class="aq-lead">Outside drugs and natural health products, no regulator sets a Purified Water grade for these uses. Your recipe, your process or your equipment maker sets the limit.</p></header><div class="aq-limit-drawer"><ol class="aq-limit-drawer__list" role="list"><li class="aq-limit-drawer__f" data-cut="0" style="--i:0;--cut:0"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__tab" aria-hidden="true"><span>01</span>Recipe</span><div class="aq-limit-drawer__body" data-theme="light"><h3 class="aq-limit-drawer__who">Recipe or brand specification</h3><p class="aq-limit-drawer__k">What it sets</p><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sets">Ingredient water above the potable legal floor: hardness, alkalinity, chlorine, minerals</p><div class="aq-limit-drawer__slip"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__clip" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sk">What to send</p><ul class="aq-limit-drawer__send"><li>Your water profile</li><li>Feed water analysis</li></ul></div><a class="aq-limit-drawer__label" href="#ind-process#food" data-wp="ind-process#food"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__lk">Where it applies</span>Food and beverage</a></div></li><li class="aq-limit-drawer__f" data-cut="1" style="--i:1;--cut:1"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__tab" aria-hidden="true"><span>02</span>Cannabis</span><div class="aq-limit-drawer__body" data-theme="light"><h3 class="aq-limit-drawer__who">Cannabis quality assurance person</h3><p class="aq-limit-drawer__k">What it sets</p><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sets">Potable water at minimum (Cannabis Regulations, s. 88.6), plus the methods they approve</p><div class="aq-limit-drawer__slip"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__clip" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sk">What to send</p><ul class="aq-limit-drawer__send"><li>Their water specification</li><li>Any pharmaceutical standard your site runs</li></ul></div><a class="aq-limit-drawer__label" href="#ind-process#food" data-wp="ind-process#food"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__lk">Where it applies</span>Cannabis products</a></div></li><li class="aq-limit-drawer__f" data-cut="2" style="--i:2;--cut:2"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__tab" aria-hidden="true"><span>03</span>Process</span><div class="aq-limit-drawer__body" data-theme="light"><h3 class="aq-limit-drawer__who">Process engineer</h3><p class="aq-limit-drawer__k">What it sets</p><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sets">Conductivity in <span class="aq-unit">µ</span>S/cm at each rinse or process stage</p><div class="aq-limit-drawer__slip"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__clip" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sk">What to send</p><ul class="aq-limit-drawer__send"><li>The limit, its stage and unit</li><li>Flow at each stage</li></ul></div><a class="aq-limit-drawer__label" href="#ind-process#industrial" data-wp="ind-process#industrial"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__lk">Where it applies</span>Industrial and energy</a></div></li><li class="aq-limit-drawer__f" data-cut="0" style="--i:3;--cut:0"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__tab" aria-hidden="true"><span>04</span>Electrolyser</span><div class="aq-limit-drawer__body" data-theme="light"><h3 class="aq-limit-drawer__who">Electrolyser stack maker</h3><p class="aq-limit-drawer__k">What it sets</p><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sets">Feed-water limits for the stack</p><div class="aq-limit-drawer__slip"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__clip" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sk">What to send</p><ul class="aq-limit-drawer__send"><li>The stack maker's feed-water specification, with revision</li></ul></div><a class="aq-limit-drawer__label" href="#ind-process#industrial" data-wp="ind-process#industrial"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__lk">Where it applies</span>Industrial and energy</a></div></li><li class="aq-limit-drawer__f" data-cut="1" style="--i:4;--cut:1"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__tab" aria-hidden="true"><span>05</span>Boiler</span><div class="aq-limit-drawer__body" data-theme="light"><h3 class="aq-limit-drawer__who">Boiler maker or treatment program</h3><p class="aq-limit-drawer__k">What it sets</p><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sets">Make-up water quality for the boiler</p><div class="aq-limit-drawer__slip"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__clip" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sk">What to send</p><ul class="aq-limit-drawer__send"><li>The make-up specification</li><li>Your treatment program's targets</li></ul></div><a class="aq-limit-drawer__label" href="#ind-process#industrial" data-wp="ind-process#industrial"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__lk">Where it applies</span>Industrial and energy</a></div></li><li class="aq-limit-drawer__f" data-cut="2" style="--i:5;--cut:2"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__tab" aria-hidden="true"><span>06</span>ASTM D1193-24</span><div class="aq-limit-drawer__body" data-theme="light"><h3 class="aq-limit-drawer__who">ASTM D1193-24 Type II or III</h3><p class="aq-limit-drawer__k">What it sets</p><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sets">Laboratory reagent water, by type</p><div class="aq-limit-drawer__slip"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__clip" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="aq-limit-drawer__sk">What to send</p><ul class="aq-limit-drawer__send"><li>The type and edition your method or customer names</li></ul></div><a class="aq-limit-drawer__label" href="#ind-hospital-lab#grades" data-wp="ind-hospital-lab#grades"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__lk">Where it applies</span>Hospitals and laboratories</a></div></li></ol><div class="aq-limit-drawer__front" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-limit-drawer__pull"></span></div></div></div></section>
</div>
